{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1692.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"40ab38e9aee76d2f1204505e25b4177e6032e4f153644c4cc3c7656be2727357","ja":"ちょっこし待っててね。\nこっちの写真だったら……。","zh":"稍微等一下哦。\n要是这张照片的话……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1692.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"9ef2cdb24614a30d062189f50011520c68de7a1622c0f27a0642ba585b77dd7f","ja":"あ、本当だ！\nすっごくかわいいミニかまくらだったんだね！","zh":"啊，真的耶！\n原来是超级可爱的小雪屋呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1692.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"a421bc9c7fe01ebbc738efbfbf4de84cb6538c22f19a4d2e438963d48e586672","ja":"うん、大きなのを作れるほど積もってないし。\nけど、子犬や子猫なら入れそうだよぉ。","zh":"嗯，积雪还没多到能做个大的。\n不过，小狗或小猫应该能钻进去哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1692.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"a690609e1588da4c831c005b8285282f3f2345a9c032b34549e59dbbc65526b2","ja":"うん、本当にかわいい……♪\nコメントにもかわいいってたくさん書いてあるわね。","zh":"嗯，真的好可爱……♪\n评论里也有很多人说可爱呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1692.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"f4f2668e0d6b8d3d01eeda7a589a80ca741be3e0a419cba4d393a2cdb86fb9fb","ja":"SNSにあげてから少ししか経ってないのに、\nみんないっぱい反応してくれてるね♪","zh":"刚发到社交平台没多久，\n大家就给了好多反响呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1692.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"9e8fcba0379daf66cdfab194461938ac895e8fca2fecda6de7f5692f4ed5a6a1","ja":"みんなも雪の写真を送ってくれてて……ええっ！？\n雪で私を作ってくれてる人がいる！","zh":"大家也给我发了雪景的照片……诶诶！？\n有人用雪堆出了我！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1692.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"6b30cd40f9870ee24f6506c1338b178cc0d6e0c84014362ba25f2b74910c018f","ja":"私のしろくまを、たくさん描いてくれてる人も\nいますよ！　すごい……嬉しい！","zh":"也有很多人画了好多我的白熊哦！\n太厉害了……好开心！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1692.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"9a8daf06c999279fcaf828f3abaf4656c86d888f186557df585a3d9dbd4bb944","ja":"ぬいぐるみ用の小さなかまくらを\n作ってる人もいるよぉ。","zh":"也有人在给玩偶做\n小雪屋哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1692.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"669bf712fd3f584ba17fe3a335ca39875993735dc7d98fe88ad560f3a5393176","ja":"なんだか、雪まつりみたいだねぇ。\nみんなで楽しめて、何よりだべさ♪","zh":"感觉就像是冰雪节一样呢。\n大家能玩得这么开心，真是比什么都好♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
